{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events"]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/Value"],"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/InstrumentationContextKey-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/15Instrumentation0A10ContextKeyP","doc:\/\/Events\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Events\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SampleRateKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SampleRate","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/InvalidSampleRate","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ScreenKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ApplicationKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeviceKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/OperatingSystemKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/LocaleKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/NetworkKey"],"title":"Context a store keeps","generated":true,"anchor":"Context-a-store-keeps"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionKey"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"SessionKey.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/SessionKey.swift#L24"},"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SessionKey","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"enum","title":"SessionKey","externalID":"s:6Events10SessionKeyO"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" key of the session an event was tracked in: a random identifier that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Enricher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (module ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sessions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") sets on every record’s context.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionKey"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination reads it from each record’s context:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let session = record.context[SessionKey.self]  \/\/ a UUID"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The identifier is a version 7 UUID: its first 48 bits are the session’s start, the timestamp","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of its first record, in Unix milliseconds, and the other 74 bits that aren’t the version and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"variant are random, never derived from the device, the user or another identifier. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enricher keeps it in memory only, so a new tracker, as on the next launch, starts a new session","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a new identifier.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A store keeps it beside each record of the session, as part of the record’s own bytes, and it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is deleted when the store deletes the record’s bytes (a ","type":"text"},{"code":"SegmentStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": once its whole segment","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is delivered). So a record recovered after a relaunch carries the session it was tracked in,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and a destination sends it under the same identifier as before. It is the one identifier in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record’s context a store keeps, and a store never keeps it apart from a record.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/sessionkey"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The types every other module shares: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the values its properties can hold, and the record a tracker makes of each event."}],"url":"\/documentation\/events","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","title":"Events"},"doc://Events/15Instrumentation0A10ContextKeyP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/15Instrumentation0A10ContextKeyP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Instrumentation.InstrumentationContextKey"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/SampleRate/init(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/events\/samplerate\/init(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"InvalidSampleRate","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events17InvalidSampleRateV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The rate "},{"code":"value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SampleRate\/init(_:)","type":"topic","title":"init(_:)"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/DeviceKey":{"title":"DeviceKey","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeviceKey","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"